/-- 00:E10 — the cut area of the graph balls of `ℤ³`, `A_r = 6(2r² + 2r + 1)` (the links between the balls of radii `r` and
`r + 1`; the ledger file's check counts them), grows at every step, `A_{r+1} = A_r + 24(r + 1)`, so the cut current
